Omnibus water bill-planning. 25LSO-0451, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains appropriations totaling $534,998 from WATER DEVELOPMENT
ACCOUNT I to the Water Development Commission. These appropriations are
effective immediately.
This bill contains appropriations totaling $980,000 from WATER DEVELOPMENT
ACCOUNT II to the Water Development Commission. These appropriations are
effective immediately.
This bill contains an appropriation of $551,000 from WATER DEVELOPMENT ACCOUNT
III to the Water Development Commission. This appropriation is effective
immediately.
DETAIL OF APPROPRIATION
Agency #: 029 Agency Name: Water Development Commission
Unit: (new) numerous
EXPENDITURE BY SERIES AND YEAR FY 2025 FY 2026 FY 2027
0600 Grant & Aid Payments $368,998 $0 $0
0900 Contractual Services Costs $33,940 $1,103,050 $560,010
Total Expenditure Per Year: $402,938 $1,103,050 $560,010
Grand Total Expenditure: $2,065,998
